url: https://lad-lab.github.io
abstract: >-
  Step-by-step protocols and documentation for the David
  Lab's FoodSeq dietary biomarker pipeline, covering DNA
  extraction, library preparation, sequencing, bioinformatic
  processing with QIIME2 and DADA2, phyloseq creation in R,
  and downstream analyses including diversity metrics,
  relative abundance, and PCA.
